      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $P$ given below?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $P$ is **not** a singular matrix\n- **II.** $P$ is a singular matrix\n- **III.** $det(P)=0$\n\n$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & \\sqrt{7} & -2 \\\\ - \\frac{1}{2} & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{7} & -6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
